WEBVTT

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.070
Your total is 3200 yen.

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:09.870
Why don't they have the volume two
of the grimoire?

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:13.580
I bought that volume one
at a used book store.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.170
You're just looking
in the wrong place.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.050
I'm happy with my purchase.

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:21.630
It's Yurine.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.180
DROPKICK ON MY DEVIL!
ANIMATED SERIES TO START

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.180
USING GRIMOIRE FROM USED BOOK STORE TO
PERFORM CONJURATION.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:26.600
It's true...

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:28.520
Aren't you hungry?

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:30.640
Let's grab a bite somewhere.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.060
What do you want?

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:33.690
Yurine!

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:35.650
What? Me?

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.860
I wanna go to Jiro.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:41.240
Let's go to Jiro.

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.990
Then why ask in the first place?

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.370
What's Jiro, anyway?

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:48.790
And... is it true?

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:50.830
We're an anime series?

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.330
Get with it, girl!

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:57.380
Won’t leave

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:03.130
without a dropkick on her!

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:09.310
Zazas Zazas Nasatanada Zazas

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:24.280
-She summoned me, the evil god.
-Evil god!

00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:26.820
-I gotta kill her or else
-What?

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:28.700
-I can’t go back to Hell!
-Sister...

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:32.410
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Life next to death, I combat with my chainsaw!

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:34.330
If you go too far,

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:38.340
I’ll slice you up completely!

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:40.590
Your halo!
Must get it back!

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:44.720
-Never miss a chance
-Hey, seriously?

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:48.930
-To attack her from behind!
-You’re so mean.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:53.180
I’ll never give up.

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:54.810
Yurine, you’re off your guard!

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:58.980
Now!
Time to finish you with the Royal Copenhagen!

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:01.900
Huh? What? I missed...

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:05.320
Can’t leave Earth

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:10.410
without a dropkick on her!

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:13.620
But until then,

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:19.540
-let’s all have fun together!
-Yeah!

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:23.710
KITCHEN JIRO

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:24.970
Welcome.

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:29.800
You always order the fried minced meat
with fried fish plate.

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:33.720
It's my favorite!
And look who's talking.

00:02:33.890 --> 00:02:36.430
You always get the scallop croquette plate.

00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:41.110
Well, yeah, it's my favorite.

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:45.740
I want a bite of that.

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:47.610
No way.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:52.370
I don't believe in sharing
or letting people try my food.

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:58.080
Just be happy with what you ordered.

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:01.960
Sorry, never mind.

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:06.590
I can't finish the rice.

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:08.630
Jashin-chan, eat the rest.

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:11.220
Okay...

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:14.600
She just contradicted herself.

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:17.890
But, if I say anything she'll get mad.
I'll just let it slide...

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:23.230
That was delicious.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:28.570
Excuse me. I'd like to order
the fried minced meat lunch set.

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:31.360
Right away!

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:34.240
What are you gonna do with that?

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:35.790
Is it for dinner?

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:38.250
I need to stop by somewhere.

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:47.760
Pekola, are you here?
I got food for you.

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:50.300
Why take care
of that fallen angel?

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:51.890
Pekola?

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:54.680
I'm not Pekola.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:56.600
Whoops, wrong one.

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:58.560
Pekola's over there.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:02.440
I see. Thank you.

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:07.570
The witch and her familiar spirit.
What do you want?

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:09.820
How rude.

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:12.240
I could kill you if I wanted to.

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:16.370
Stop! Since I lost my halo
not only am I weak,

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:20.500
I'm also starving to death.
I can barely move.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:24.250
That's why I brought you this.

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:28.460
A fried minced meat lunch set?

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:32.430
For me...?

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:39.430
No! As an angel,
I can't accept food from a witch!

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:41.640
Please go home.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:43.900
Just so you know, I'm not a witch.

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:48.070
Do what you want.

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:51.400
I'll just leave this here.

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:57.830
Let's go, Jashin-chan.

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:59.120
Okay.

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:17.140
I want it so bad!

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.260
No! I can't!

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:23.100
What angel accepts food
from a witch?

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:29.440
But, I can't just let the food
go to waste either.

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:31.820
Never mind the witch,

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:35.700
wouldn't it be disrespectful
to the chef if I didn't eat it?

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:38.870
Right! I'll eat it for the chef!

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:40.030
Bon appetit!

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:41.200
THIS IS PEKOLA'S IMAGINATION

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:43.290
All right! Let's eat!

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:49.750
Smells so good...

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:54.800
What are you doing here?

00:05:56.550 --> 00:06:00.140
Since you weren't gonna eat it,
thought I'd eat it for you.

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:01.810
Didn't want to waste it!

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:09.400
What? Did you want to eat it?

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:11.900
Of course not.

00:06:12.190 --> 00:06:13.400
Good.

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:24.620
That was the last bite.

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:29.460
So juicy and delicious!

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:35.170
That meat was to die for!
I know, I'm not the best food reporter...

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:37.720
All done! Here, throw this away.

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:40.890
I'm so satisfied!

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:44.600
Jeez, my stomach's a bottomless pit.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.480
That's okay.

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:52.480
I was able to protect my dignity
as an angel.

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:58.320
I'll drink some water
and go to bed.

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:02.990
Patrasche, I'm tired now.

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:11.790
HOURS LATER

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:16.300
You disappeared
on the way back home.

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:20.550
Don't tell me you went back
and ate Pekola's food.

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:23.050
No. I didn't eat it.

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:25.560
-Are you sure?
-Yeah!

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:29.060
If you don't tell me the truth...

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:37.070
I'll mince your arm
into pieces.

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:39.400
Yeah! I ate it! I ate it!

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:47.080
We'll serve fried Jashin-chan meat
for dinner tonight.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:50.120
PLEASE WAIT A MOMENT

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:55.040
I'm gonna go to Jiro to get
Pekola some food again.

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:58.090
So, restore your arm
and clean up the mess. Okay?

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:02.840
Damn it.

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:05.350
I even told her the truth.

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:07.390
Damn it!

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:09.350
PIPING HOT
FRIED MINCED MEAT

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:19.780
Bless the witch!

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.200
Hello!

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:32.870
I brought something cool
from Hell for you.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:35.040
Check out the Mandragora doll!

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:38.340
Also known as the mandrake.

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:42.130
Legend says anyone
who pulls them out

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:45.760
and hears their screams
goes mad and dies!

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:50.270
You press the stomach
to hear its death scream.

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:51.600
Listen.

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:55.770
That's freaky.

00:08:57.150 --> 00:08:58.730
That's so metal.

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:00.440
So lame.

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:02.400
-Like it?
-Yup.

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:05.990
Good. The Mandragora's happy too.

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:08.030
Jashin-chan is such a sleaze.

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:11.870
But her friends, Medusa and Minos,
are so nice.

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:14.040
Even though Jashin-chan's such a jerk.

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:17.920
She's not even my friend anyway.

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:19.630
Hey, that's not nice.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:21.300
What?

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:24.760
Do you have any idea how many
times I got hurt because of you?

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:28.260
-I'll push you, Jashin-chan!
-What?

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:29.760
Here you go!

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:35.520
Let's play some more!

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:38.150
Leave me alone.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:41.650
Come on, let's go!

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:43.990
What's going on?

00:09:44.490 --> 00:09:46.360
I dislocated my back...

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:53.910
I apologized right then and there.
It wasn't on purpose either.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:56.500
That's not the point!

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:58.540
You gotta be more careful!

00:09:58.710 --> 00:09:59.790
You meathead!

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:03.210
What? This is all because you're so weak!

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:07.050
What? I'm not weak! Try me!

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:08.430
Let's do it.

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:10.510
I'll show you!

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:13.810
Take this! Jashin-chan Dropkick!

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:16.810
The animation!

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:18.190
Go!

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:21.440
You think I'm scared of that?

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:42.670
Hey, Mandragora...

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:48.340
NO RESPONSE.
IT'S PROBABLY DEAD.

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:51.850
That was its real death scream.

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:54.810
Oh, well.

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:56.520
It was freaky anyway.

00:10:56.680 --> 00:10:58.560
Right, Yurine?

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:02.570
I was getting pretty attached to it.

00:11:04.110 --> 00:11:05.230
Yurine?

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:10.030
Well, I gotta go deliver the evening paper.
See you later.

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:11.950
Minos, you traitor!

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:15.370
The death scream...

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:17.410
I thought it was pretty cute.

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:20.830
It's a rare toy too.

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:24.960
Need I say more?

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:30.760
There we go.

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:34.600
Oh, come on. Give me a better scream.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:38.100
The Mandragora's death scream
was way better than that.

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:40.600
Stop... I can't do it...

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:46.230
Scream loud and clear.

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:53.570
No matter how hard I work,

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:56.040
life just gets harder and harder.

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:57.910
I'll just stare at my hand.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.210
Working is fun!

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:02.710
You work, you lose.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.210
I'll just stare at my hand.

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:21.690
Good morning, mascot of India.

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:25.690
How's the new room, Totem Pole?

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:27.610
Bus-tine.

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:31.860
It took a lot of effort
to get you here.

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:36.870
I love how the bus schedule
is posted right there.

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.580
You're my precious babies.

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:44.500
I just need Orochimaru
to complete my collection.

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:48.380
Shoot! I'm gonna be late!

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:57.640
I, Mei Tachibana, the super cop of the Banzaibashi Police
will protect this land from all evil!

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:06.310
I must stay on high alert for weirdos
while I'm on patrol.

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:15.780
Are you okay?

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:17.450
I'm fine.

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:20.450
I just have a weak body.

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:24.460
Excuse me.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:28.960
She had such a cute voice.

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:31.510
All clear.

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:34.720
Excuse me, sir.

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:37.050
Are you interested in woodblock prints?

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:38.800
Woodblock prints?

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:42.480
They're a bit pricey,
but you can pay in installments.

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:45.310
It'll be a good investment
for your future.

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:49.610
Let me show you.

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:52.440
Sure.

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:55.660
-I'll just take a look.
-One silkscreen please!

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:58.280
GALLERY

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:00.120
NEGOTIATING

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:02.200
Yup, all clear.

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.000
How wonderful!

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:16.970
I love his form and his wacky
Halloween-ish outfit.

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:21.350
He's so beautiful, I'm tearing up.

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:24.810
I'm going to take him home.

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:27.140
Here we go.

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:29.770
Excuse me.

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:33.860
Is there a problem with that figure?

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:37.200
Did someone plant a bomb on it?

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:41.530
No, I'm taking him home
because he's so cute.

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:46.370
He wants to go home with me too, right?

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:47.750
"Yes, I do."

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:49.080
See?

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:50.670
What a freak.

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:53.380
I better call the police.

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:56.920
But wait, is she a cop?
I'm so confused.

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:59.140
I'm just a part-timer.

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:01.350
What am I supposed to do?

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:02.680
Let's go!

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:06.140
Wait! You can't take our mascot!

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:09.100
-Did you just touch my butt?
-What?

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:12.980
He's a pervert!
Someone call the cops! Help!

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:15.320
I didn't touch you!

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:17.070
I'm taking him home.

00:15:17.320 --> 00:15:19.570
Let go, you freak.

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:23.910
-It's that freak from the other day.
-This belongs to the shop.

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:29.870
I was meeting up with Medusa,
but I can't let her see me.

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:31.710
Jashin-chan!

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:35.880
Jashin-chan? Orochimaru!

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:38.090
Were you waiting for a while?

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:40.550
I bought you some chicken.

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:42.010
What's wrong?

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:45.260
Forget this! I want Orochimaru!

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:48.390
Damn it! She saw me!

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:51.480
Orochimaru! Wait, my dear!

00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:54.900
I have to get away from her!

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:58.360
Jeez, slow down!

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:00.990
What's going on?

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:02.950
Did you do something?

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:05.580
You have to make up for your crimes.

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:07.330
Shut up!

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:13.000
Orochimaru!

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:19.260
Bull's-eye!

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:22.010
Jashin-chan! Are you okay?

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:23.890
Not at all.

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:25.300
I LOVE OROCHIMARU

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:28.520
Gotcha!

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:31.940
Oh, Orochimaru.

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:35.360
So beautiful... So cute...

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:37.190
So smooth.

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:38.400
Stop it!

00:16:39.650 --> 00:16:42.740
Orochimaru's the best!

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:45.910
Time for our celebratory selfie!

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:49.330
Stop! I can't!

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:55.920
JASHIN-CHAN DOUBLE PEACE

00:16:56.090 --> 00:16:57.590
Nice shot!

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:06.300
Everything looks delicious.

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:09.930
Pekola, don't forget about dessert.

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:11.770
Have some nectar too.

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:12.940
ANGEL IN TRAINING

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:16.560
This is so much food.

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:22.700
Steak, onion soup...

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:26.070
Parfait, cake, unleavened bread...

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:28.200
Bagna cauda...

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:29.490
-Tiramisu...
-Hey!

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:32.500
-Fried minced meat...
-Hey, wake up!

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:35.460
I'm talking to you, part-timer!

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:38.380
Me?

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.670
You're here to work.

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:43.300
Don't daydream while you're on the clock.

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:45.720
Come on, move it.

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:49.510
Why do I get treated like this?

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:52.390
I was an angel, you know?

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:57.810
We're forced to climb up the stairs
with heavy loads on our backs.

00:17:57.980 --> 00:18:00.320
Are we building a pyramid
or something?

00:18:00.900 --> 00:18:06.030
We climb up the stairs
and go back down in an elevator.

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:09.530
How much longer will I last?

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:12.120
For 400 yen per hour?

00:18:12.580 --> 00:18:15.870
Why is it so low?

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:18.540
Isn't Tokyo's minimum wage 958 yen?

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:23.340
But, I have to do this to survive.

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:29.300
No other place would hire me
without a background check.

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:33.850
There. That was heavy.

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:36.600
What could possibly be in there?

00:18:37.020 --> 00:18:40.560
Hurry up and carry the next load,
part-timer!

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:44.690
That guy really sounds like an idiot.

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:45.860
DOESN'T SOUND INTELLIGENT AT ALL

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:54.290
Is it just me, or are we doing all of this backwards?

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:02.170
The theory of relativity
and warp navigation

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:06.130
parallels the relationship
between dark matter and black holes...

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:09.260
So, that means...

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:14.640
What have I gotten myself into?
This is bad. Really, really bad.

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:23.940
This one seems normal.

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:29.990
The giant mantis...

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:33.620
He's coming to kill me!

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:37.540
Stop. Don't come near me!

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:39.710
Stay away!

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:44.500
Praying mantis...

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:49.590
Trust me!
You won't like how I taste!

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:58.020
The giant mantis...

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:00.810
Mantis...

00:20:03.480 --> 00:20:04.940
Praying mantis!

00:20:05.190 --> 00:20:07.440
Oh, no. Praying mantis...

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:13.740
I'm so tipsy.

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:17.040
Hey, fallen angel.

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.000
Sushi's a rare delicacy for you, right?

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:22.920
It's actually for Yurine,

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:26.130
but I could feed you
a couple pieces.

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:46.360
LAYING ON TOP OF HER THROW UP.

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:53.700
I'm beat.

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:57.030
It is nice that they pay in cash.

00:20:57.740 --> 00:21:01.710
But I only got 3200 yen
for eight straight hours of work.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:05.830
I'll spend 1000 yen for food
and necessities

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:09.340
and put 2200 in my savings.

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:13.680
I need to get some sleep
in order to do this again tomorrow.

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:22.770
My house!

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:25.850
You again?

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:35.860
After slaving all day,

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:38.870
the devil destroys my home.

00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:43.000
Nobody's coming for me from Heaven.

00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:46.210
I'm...

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:48.250
I'm...

00:22:07.900 --> 00:22:09.610
Whoa, a shooting star!

00:22:31.040 --> 00:22:34.670
Dropkick on her! Yeah her!
I’ll take you down again!

00:22:34.840 --> 00:22:39.600
Hate you!
Love doesn’t exist in this world

00:22:40.300 --> 00:22:44.930
Fear the dropkick!
An Angel looks for her halo

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:49.350
As she starves to death!

00:22:49.520 --> 00:22:51.980
It’s a love and hate relationship,

00:22:52.190 --> 00:22:54.190
can’t leave each other alone

00:22:54.360 --> 00:22:58.860
Like a galaxy-bursting shooting star!

00:22:59.030 --> 00:23:03.080
Slowly, slowly, sneak up and DIE!

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:05.450
Test my heart, don’t stop

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:12.540
Let’s go! Dream on! No matter human, angel or devil

00:23:12.710 --> 00:23:16.800
We’re a happy family La la la

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:21.050
Let me say, I love you!!

00:23:21.220 --> 00:23:23.510
When all is said and done

00:23:23.720 --> 00:23:28.230
I’m home! Welcome back, it’s hot pot tonight!

00:23:28.390 --> 00:23:32.900
Come, gather everyone! Let’s enjoy this meal!

00:23:33.070 --> 00:23:35.150
For another crazy tomorrow

00:23:35.320 --> 00:23:38.820
What next? What next? In the end, Wakeup!

00:23:41.820 --> 00:23:43.160
Gospel echoes.

00:23:43.330 --> 00:23:46.250
Jacob's ladder comes down from the cloudy sky.

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:49.580
New angel decend from above with the light.

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:52.080
Dropkick on My Devil!

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:54.920
We'll shining wizard into your
heart in the next episode too!
